                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Should this be `systemd_system_unit_dir`?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/meson.build",
                    "line": 2,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William de Abreu Pinho",
                        "email": "williamdapinho@gmail.com",
                        "username": "williamdap"
                    },
                    "message": "Maybe I am missing some context, but isn't this the standard one provided by pkg-config?\n```\n$ pkg-config systemd --variable=systemdsystemunitdir\n/usr/lib/systemd/system\n```"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/meson.build",
                    "line": 2,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William de Abreu Pinho",
                        "email": "williamdapinho@gmail.com",
                        "username": "williamdap"
                    },
                    "message": "Acknowledged"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/meson.build",
                    "line": 2,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Looking at the git-blame in systemd, it appears that they consider the non-underscore ones as \"deprecated\".  That was my rationale for preferring the underscore-separated ones.\n\nhttps://github.com/systemd/systemd/blame/e21cd6db9cd21c4b1882b67c5f1ad648b9b45b05/src/core/systemd.pc.in#L4"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/meson.build",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I don't think this part is needed.  Isn't it just svc?\n\n```\n$ rg \"systemd_system_unit_dir\" /usr/share/pkgconfig/systemd.pc       \n28:systemd_system_unit_dir=${prefix}/lib/systemd/system\n29:systemdsystemunitdir=${systemd_system_unit_dir}\n```\n\n`systemd/system` seems to already be there."
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/meson.build",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "William de Abreu Pinho",
                        "email": "williamdapinho@gmail.com",
                        "username": "williamdap"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "service_files/obmc-led-group-start@.service",
                    "line": 11,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Can we just use a `busctl set-property` call?  (I know you copied this; maybe we can refactor in a follow up commit?)"
                },
                {
